WEBVTT

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.610
Paint on my hands and the radio low

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:08.870
Counting the cracks in the window glow

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.510
Everybody told me slow down, slow down

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:15.350
But my heart don’t know how

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:19.210
Turn it up

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.400
Till the walls start shaking

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.940
Turn it up, turn it up

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:26.960
Every street is waking

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.200
I don’t need a spotlight

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:31.960
I’m the spark tonight

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.500
I’m the spark, till the walls start shaking

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:35.260
I’m the spark
